ummary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**Describe the bug**\r\n\r\nWhen I install harfbuzz it always installs freetype with configuration [bzip2,core,png] even when I specify [core]. It seems that dependency resolution does not consider manual dependencies specified on command line.\r\n\r\n**Environment**\r\n- Windows. \r\n- Version: e1fc03c47. vcpkg_from_git: Add support for git over ssh\r\n\r\n**To Reproduce**\r\nSteps to reproduce the behavior:\r\n1. vcpkg.exe --triplet x86-windows install freetype[core] harfbuzz[core,ucdn]\r\n\r\nOutput:\r\n```\r\n  * bzip2[core]:x86-windows\r\n    freetype[bzip2,core,png]:x86-windows\r\n    harfbuzz[core,ucdn]:x86-windows\r\n  * libpng[core]:x86-windows\r\n  * ragel[core]:x86-windows\r\n  * zlib[core]:x86-windows\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Expected behavior**\r\n\r\nOnly install freetype[core] packages:\r\n\r\nExpected Output:\r\n```\r\n    freetype[core]:x86-windows\r\n    harfbuzz[core,ucdn]:x86-windows\r\n  * ragel[core]:x86-windows\r\n  * zlib[core]:x86-windows\r\n```\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"cbezault","id":1790974,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3OTA5NzQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1790974?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cbezault","html_url":"https://github.com/cbezault","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cbezault/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cbezault/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cbezault/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cbezault/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cbezault/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cbezault/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cbezault/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cbezault/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/user